WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:34.400
Lei En and I are battling it out

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.050
in the Knife Skills Competition
to win the legendary cookware.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.930
The requirement of the competition is to cook four dishes

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:41.440
with pagrus major

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.090
caught at sunrise.

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:46.290
When Lei En’s seven knives

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.830
and his speed are wowing the audience,

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.830
I’ve just started to prepare my fish

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:54.870
with a steel wire and a special knife.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.480
That can’t be.

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:00.490
That’s exclusive

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:01.510
to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.870
I’ll win the Knife Skills Competition

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.680
with this Hundred-Hole Knife!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:12.270
Four Regions All in China in Pagrus Major

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.830
Both of them seem to have finished.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:28.280
Elders of the Guangzhou Cook League,

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.580
Elder Guan, Elder Yan, Elder Su

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.140
and I

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:36.930
will be the judges.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.920
First up, Lei En’s dish.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:01.670
My first dish is sashimi.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.430
You’ll be tasting flesh

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.420
around the dorsal fin and the tail.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:07.710
It’s extremely difficult

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.360
to separate those parts.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.140
And you’ve done it perfectly.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.030
That level of perfection

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.030
shows your excellent skills.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.000
The fresh taste and the clean cut

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.720
require extreme precision.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:33.360
Fantastic!

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.020
The texture

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.300
of the constant moving tail is so firm

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:38.720
and elastic that the meat is bouncing in my mouth.

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:41.110
This kind of delicacy

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.980
can only be achieved by top knife skills.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.850
It tastes so good!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:49.760
Well done!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.750
His reputation is well-deserved.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.270
Bring us your second dish.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.690
Braised fish head with vegetables.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.730
That nice smell

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.800
reminds me of the ocean.

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.740
The broth is rich and thick.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:16.030
It looks good.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:17.200
Silang!

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.890
It’s so flavorful!

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.510
The fish head with fat

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.100
is melting in my mouth!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:35.270
I can’t stop eating it.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:37.600
What’s next? What’s the next dish?

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.110
Thin slices.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.170
He’s indeed highly skilled.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.400
Those slices are unusually thin.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.910
Some skills he got!

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:48.640
But, after tasting

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.460
your first sashimi dish,

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:51.760
this plate of raw fish seems rather normal.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.410
No, sir.

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:55.060
This is the main course.

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:56.590
The main course?

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:57.510
This one?

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.540
I recommend you

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:05.510
to dip the slices into this fish soup

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.870
before eating.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.470
That’s unique.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:14.900
Let's see

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:16.320
if it’ll match the first two dishes.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:42.180
It’s out of this world!

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.550
(Out of This World)

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.940
The silky smooth,

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.970
thin slices,

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.930
and the rich soup are a wonderful combination.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:55.860
I could eat

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.890
hundreds of them like this!

00:05:58.450 --> 00:05:59.580
I wish

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.290
I could taste it myself!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.360
Don’t drool over our enemy’s dish!

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:04.900
I know how you feel, though.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:06.300
That’s right.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.950
Even though he’s me and my mother’s enemy

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:11.220
from the Dark Cooking Society,

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.010
no double Lei En is

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:14.640
one hell of a chef!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:15.910
Lei En.

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.410
Lei En, what’s your last dish?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.730
The last one is specially steamed fish head.

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:24.310
He’s playing safe

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.080
in the end

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:27.590
with a classic dish.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.640
The juice

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:38.870
is sealed inside.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:40.990
Very nice!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:41.640
It’s delicious!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.370
My tongue almost got burned.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.160
It’s hot!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.050
All four judges

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:49.420
look enchanted.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:53.180
Yes! Lei En’s dishes are superb!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.520
I’m amazed by his skills.

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.680
No wonder Luo Wu

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:03.760
called him a genius.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.620
Mao can handle this, right?

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.860
It won’t be as easy as before.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:13.650
This time, he’s against someone

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.020
way above his former adversaries’ level.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:19.760
Mao...

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.710
Mao will be fine.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.290
He’ll win regardless.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:30.150
As flamboyant as his skills look,

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:33.180
they're derived from the basics.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.230
He didn’t use a single technique of
the Dark Cooking Society

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:38.560
throughout the entire process.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:39.870
But why?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.400
We’ve tasted

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.370
all four of Lei En’s dishes.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.230
It’s your turn, Mao,

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.070
Bring us your dishes.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.120
Yes.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:11.890
What’s this?

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:12.690
What is that?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:13.960
Pagrus major.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:17.210
Don’t I know that?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.660
Liu Maoxing, is this your first dish?

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.190
No, sir.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.760
It's all I’ve got.

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:25.690
What?

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.740
What does he mean?

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:29.600
What to do?

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.980
Is that all? A whole fish?

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:33.780
Has that thing even been cooked?

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.320
Aren’t they supposed to cook four dishes?

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.030
I know, right?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.240
Let me see what you made

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:40.970
with that Hundred-Hole Knife.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.300
Need I remind you

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:44.190
that this is

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.620
a four-course competition?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.680
One short

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:51.100
and you’ll lose.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.220
I know.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.110
Silang, give me a hand.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.200
Me?

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:00.510
Go ahead!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.310
What are you waiting for?

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.220
Go!

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.890
Come on, kid!

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:08.000
Go ahead, little one!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.470
Thank you. Thanks.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.770
What’s up?

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.540
What do you need me to do?

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:17.140
Listen carefully, Silang,

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.020
we need to cut off the wire on both sides together.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.040
What? A wire?

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:27.290
Yes, there is one.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.000
I didn’t notice it.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.090
Are you ready?

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.380
Do it together on my count,

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:34.240
understand?

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.000
Got it.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:48.530
So, are you ready, Silang?

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.240
OK. I’m ready.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:52.140
One, two...

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:58.830
What’s that?

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.510
That glare!

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:02.540
What... What is this?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:09.810
The body...

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.910
The body is spreading out like a fan!

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:27.410
What...?

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:28.610
What am I looking at?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.150
Mao, the fish...

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:42.850
Is that...?

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:49.830
Is that the Chinese mainland?

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:54.100
That's right. It is the Chinese mainland!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:57.710
Putting the whole continent into a fish!

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:58.490
He turned that fish

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.510
into the Chinese mainland!

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:02.180
Liu Maoxing specially presents:

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:04.320
Chinese mainland in Pagrus Major.

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:05.920
It is complete!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.870
Unbelievable!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.880
He carved out the whole continent with fish!

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:12.780
That’s bold and ambitious!

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:22.010
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:26.650
Liu Maoxing specially presents:
Chinese mainland in Pagrus Major!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.090
He put together the Chinese mainland

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.560
with fish.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:35.080
That takes great skills.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:36.710
You’re a genius,

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:37.610
Mao!

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:43.790
Mao!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.740
Four corners of the continent

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.690
are clearly shown.

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:50.100
There must be more

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:51.370
to the presentation.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.210
Let's taste it.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.110
I’ll take the east.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.180
I’ll start with the west.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.820
Is… is it...?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.110
Absolutely!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.670
This fish

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:12.290
covers the tastes

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:13.500
(Peking Sichuan Shanghai Shandong)
of the four major culinary regions

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:14.790
(Peking Sichuan Shanghai Shandong)
in the Chinese mainland.

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:17.730
What? Really?

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:20.740
Four tastes in one fish?

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:23.280
This must be Peking!

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.860
(Peking)

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.460
The fillet was roasted with salt

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.710
in the style of Peking Duck.

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:32.750
Wrap the meat and scallion with pancakes.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:34.400
I can drink dozens of wine

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.880
with it.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:39.150
Sichuan!

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.590
(Sichuan)

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.940
The thick meat in the middle

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.770
was coated and fried

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:46.810
and topped with

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:49.070
hot chili oil.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:50.590
Shanghai!

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.810
(Shanghai)

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:53.710
Shanghai crab roe

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:55.740
was stuffed

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:57.180
in every slice of the raw tail.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.280
What a masterpiece!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:01.750
I got Guangdong.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.070
(Guangdong)

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.880
The fat belly meat

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.620
was mixed with local fresh vegetables

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:09.710
and seasoned with oyster sauce.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.300
The combination

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.810
of the fresh fish and vegetables

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.980
is unimaginable!

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.680
It’s like having a bit of spring!

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:24.970
It’s good!

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:25.770
So tasty!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:26.680
Am I in a dream?

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:27.550
I feel the same.

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:32.810
Yes!

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.580
That’s what I’m talking about,

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.010
Mao!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:37.510
Silang...

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.250
Attaboy!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.850
He made the whole continent with fish!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.330
Few could

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.700
think outside the box like him.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.770
What he did is unprecedented!

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:59.130
The four of us

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:03.100
have reached a unanimous decision.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:10.700
Who will be the winner?

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:15.680
Mao or Lei En?

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.720
The two of them...

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.340
are equally skilled!

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:34.850
I declare...

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.080
I declare this one a tie!

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.020
Wait!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:38.960
What’s up with Lei En?

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:39.910
What’s going on?

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.060
What’s wrong?

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.080
Let’s settle this with a fence-off.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.340
A fence-off?

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.440
He ignored the judges’ decision!

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:50.690
Who does he think he is?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.130
Bring it on!

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.670
Mao said yes.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:56.550
Go, go, go!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.240
Knock him down!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.820
You fool! This is no street fight!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.450
Will the judges allow it?

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:05.430
It’s not good.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.920
One more round is bad for Mao.

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.610
Excuse me!

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:13.650
He’s as skilled as Lei En!

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.280
Didn’t you see what happened out there?

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:17.410
What I’m saying is

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.260
Lei En hasn’t used

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.810
any techniques of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:23.720
You’re right.

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.250
We haven’t seen anything

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:32.050
like Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.920
What’s happening, father?

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.800
Lei En has still got

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:39.730
a trump card up in his sleeve.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:40.710
A trump card?

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:49.070
Alright.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:50.500
This might be the best

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.640
for both of you.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.400
If you’re fine with it,

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.230
so will we.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.040
But, Lei En,

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.180
there’s only one fish left.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:04.140
That’s enough.

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:05.960
We’ll use it to break the tie.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.740
Liu Maoxing,

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.500
Looks like you’re more than a Super Chef.

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:14.570
Super Chefs

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.070
are said

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.640
to bring people happiness.

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.440
Chinese mainland in Pagrus Major

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:22.510
is clearly a work

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:23.590
of a Super Chef.

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:24.740
However...

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.040
He did use

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.000
the Hundred-Hole Knife

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:33.930
unique to the Dark Cooking Society.

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:35.610
Who on earth is he?

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:51.820
Is that...?

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:55.380
This is my last knife,

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:57.270
a secret one of the Dark Cooking Society,

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:58.770
the North Star Sirius Blade.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.530
He’s got one more knife!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.840
That must be his trump card!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:05.430
Oh, no!

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:08.240
We got nothing! Nothing at all!

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:09.520
Mao doesn’t have anything

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:12.350
except for that steel wire and Hundred-Hole Knife.

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.010
Under this circumstance,

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.280
the odds are against Mao.

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:22.170
Kid,

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.990
I don’t care who you are

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:26.970
but let me be clear.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.010
You are

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:34.030
standing in my way.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:38.540
What's so funny?

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:40.800
Nothing.

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:42.040
I’m simply having fun.

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:42.680
What?

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.200
You’re a great chef.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:46.910
And I’m sure

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:48.900
you’ll come up with something great, too.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:52.240
This is no game

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.080
but a serious competition.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.640
Once I draw out this blade,

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:57.960
your chance of winning

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.860
will be slim.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.740
Say something, Mao!

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.700
Or is he really going to lose?

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:08.900
As you can see,

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:10.230
this fish is all we have.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:12.410
Take whatever you want.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.660
I’ll cook with the rest.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:17.570
This competition

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.770
is more like a game to you.

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:20.600
Pardon?

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:27.400
What are you doing?

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.970
You can’t do this to pagrus major!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:50.490
Excellent!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:54.940
Nicely done!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:58.470
Even the bones are cut in half.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:01.410
He didn’t damage anything!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:02.610
Unbelievable!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.560
He’s really something!

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:09.220
Lei En, you’re an outstanding chef

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.470
and a worthy opponent.

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:11.790
I’ll give it my all

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:13.240
and I expect

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:15.100
the same from you.

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.530
Or you will lose.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:19.530
Interesting!

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.990
The stronger the opponent is,

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.770
the better it feels to crush him.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:31.480
Yes! Mao is as good!

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.390
He cut the fish in half in a flash!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.330
He’s more determined than ever.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.690
We're going to win.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:37.580
No.

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.990
Mao is still at a disadvantage.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:41.220
Why?

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:42.700
Because he can only use

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.330
the steel wire and Hundred-Hole Knife,

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:46.300
and Lei En

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:47.830
has seen

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:49.060
what Mao can do with those tools.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.540
Will that change anything?

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.040
Mao has brought down

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.670
tons of chefs stronger than him

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:55.930
even when the situation is unfavorable,

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.040
including you!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.980
But none of them

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:00.640
is Lei En.

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:02.050
That man is a mysterious beast.

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:03.150
What’s worse,

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:05.320
we have no idea

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.200
what that last knife of his is capable of.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.710
Did Mao’s mother happen to

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:12.070
mention that knife in her notes?

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:13.330
I don’t think so.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:16.000
I guess that knife

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.770
had been sealed at the Dark Cooking Society

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:20.090
before Lei En

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:21.290
gained the right to use it.

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:24.380
I doubt Chef Pei knew anything about it.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.400
Are you ready?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.700
The fence-off

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.520
of the Knife Skills Competition shall commence.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.800
Also, the final showdown.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:42.360
I didn’t mean to use this one.

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:47.260
The secret knife, North Star Sirius Blade!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.370
It’s out!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.290
What... what is that thing?

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:11.510
It’s dazzling!

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.750
It looks like a bloodthirsty weapon!

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:19.400
What is that knife?

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:27.730
That fish was caught at sunrise.

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:29.850
The fence-off

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:32.300
is all about

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.310
conquering the judges’ tastes.

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:38.050
The previous round is only a warm-up.

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:41.450
My ultimate sashimi from the same fish

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.510
will give you

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:45.170
a taste of heaven!

00:23:15.059 --> 00:23:17.061
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.031 --> 00:23:20.960
Lei En pulled out his trump card, a hidden secret knife.

00:23:21.345 --> 00:23:23.990
This creepy knife, which I have never seen before,

00:23:24.075 --> 00:23:25.916
hides a terrifying secret.

00:23:26.816 --> 00:23:28.150
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.719 --> 00:23:29.687
Ice and Flame!

00:23:29.906 --> 00:23:32.135
Clash! A Chef's Soul

00:23:32.523 --> 00:23:33.941
It will definitely be interesting!
